// Title: HackTool - WSASS Execution
// Rule ID: 589ac73f-8e12-409c-964e-31a2f5775ae2
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1003.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
